 home=f'<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-main"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> MEDIA · MARKETING · COMMERCIAL PARTNERSHIPS</p><h1>Good ideas<br>deserve a<br><em>bigger world.</em></h1><div class="hero-bottom"><p>We connect stories, brands and people.<br>For opportunities that go beyond borders.</p>{a("contact/","Build your next move ↗","solid")}</div></div><aside class="hero-side"><span class="vertical-label">INDEPENDENT SPIRIT. GLOBAL OUTLOOK.</span><div class="sculpture" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sculpture-ring ring-one"></div><div class="sculpture-ring ring-two"></div><div class="sculpture-ring ring-three"></div><span>↗</span></div><div class="hero-caption"><span>01 / THE ZAWATU WAY</span><p>A fresh perspective.<br>A meaningful connection.<br>A reason to move forward.</p></div></aside></section><div class="scope-bar wrap"><span>BASED IN BURUNDI</span><span class="scope-line"></span><span>COLLABORATING ACROSS BORDERS</span><span>EN / FR</span></div><section class="section wrap"><div class="section-top"><span class="eyebrow">01 / WHAT WE DO</span>{a("services/","All services ↗","text-link")}</div><div class="intro-grid"><h2>Attention is a start.<br><em>Connection is the opportunity.</em></h2><p>We help businesses communicate clearly, create compelling campaigns and meet the right partners. Every engagement begins with your objective.</p></div>{cards()}</section><section class="feature section wrap"><div class="feature-visual"><div class="feature-title"><span>THE IDEA LAB / 001</span><span>CONCEPT STUDY</span></div><div class="umbrella-drawing" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 380 300"><path d="M40 130a150 120 0 0 1 300 0c-25-20-50-20-75 0-25-20-50-20-75 0-25-20-50-20-75 0-25-20-50-20-75 0Z"/><path d="M190 130v100c0 45 55 45 55 0M190 10c-48 20-75 60-75 120M190 10c48 20 75 60 75 120M190 0v10"/></svg></div><strong>Useful.<br>Memorable.<br><em>Everywhere.</em></strong></div><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / THINKING BEYOND THE OBVIOUS</span><h2>One useful object.<br><em>A different business idea.</em></h2><p>A customer gift. A brand’s visibility. A supplier’s order. One campaign can connect three different needs—and give everyone a reason to participate.</p><p class="fine">An illustrative concept, not a client case study.</p>{a("campaigns/","Explore the thinking ↗","text-link")}</div></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="section-top"><span class="eyebrow">03 / THE BLOG</span>{a("blog/","Visit the blog ↗","text-link")}</div><h2>Ideas worth sharing.<br><em>Perspectives worth exploring.</em></h2><div class="articles">'+''.join(card(x,i) for i,x in enumerate(ART[:3]))+'</div></section><section class="global section wrap"><div><span class="eyebrow">04 / OPEN TO THE WORLD</span><h2>Rooted in Burundi.<br><em>Thinking beyond borders.</em></h2><p>We welcome conversations with businesses, creators and partners wherever there is a relevant opportunity. Remote collaboration and work on the ground are scoped around each project.</p>'+a('about/','Meet Zawatu ↗','text-link')+'</div><div class="world-mark" aria-hidden="true"><span>WORLDWIDE<br><em>starts with a<br>conversation.</em></span></div></section>'+cta()
