 page('transparency/','Transparency & privacy','Our approach to publishing, privacy and commercial collaboration.',hero('TRANSPARENCY','A clear basis<br><em>for trust.</em>','Useful content, identifiable commercial relationships and clear handling of requests.')+f'<section class="section wrap"><div class="prose"><h2>This presentation</h2><p>Zawatu presents media, marketing, PR and commercial partnership services. Campaign studies are illustrative. No clients, testimonials or outcomes are invented. Complete legal contracting details are provided with a proposal and remain to be added to this website.</p><h2>Contact and office</h2><p>{e(S["address"])}. Contact: {e(S["email"])}.</p><h2>Forms and appointments</h2><p>Appointment requests prepare an email draft in your browser. You review and send it through your mail service. This website does not store form data, reserve appointments or collect payments. A connected Calendly link opens that provider’s service, subject to its terms and the event’s details.</p><h2>Editorial and sponsorship</h2><p>Sponsored content will be identified. No advertising or affiliate tracking programme is active in this release.</p><h2>Technical access and rights</h2><p>No analytics or advertising scripts are included. The host may process technical access data. Contact us for corrections or permission to reuse content.</p></div></section>')
